# Keep the working tree LF-only so file-reading tests (conformance
# fixtures, insta snapshots) see byte-identical input on Windows as on
# the ubuntu/macos CI runners. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true`
# rewrites text files to CRLF at checkout and snapshot tests fail with
# phantom `\r\n` diffs that CI never reproduces.
* text=auto eol=lf
